  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TWO Kapenta Fishing and Marketing Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to increase the groups production of dried Kapentaand improve and expand marketing efforts. The funds will allow for the purchase of three fishing boats; construction of a processing factory and procurement and installation of a packing line. The funds will also be used to support income generating activities and employment for women and youth.</narrative>
  </description>
